sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Nguoi dung
    participant FE as Frontend (tokenStore)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AuthSvc as Auth Service
    participant Google as Google Identity
    participant DB as saigonvoice_auth_db

    alt Dang nhap Email va Mat khau
        User->>FE: Nhap email va mat khau
        FE->>GW: POST /api/auth/login
        GW->>AuthSvc: Forward POST /api/auth/login
        AuthSvc->>DB: Kiem tra nguoi dung, so khop BCrypt
    else Dang nhap Google
        User->>FE: Chon Dang nhap bang Google
        FE->>Google: Nhan ID Token tu SDK
        FE->>GW: POST /api/auth/google
        GW->>AuthSvc: Forward POST /api/auth/google
        AuthSvc->>Google: Xac thuc ID Token qua GoogleIdTokenVerifier
        AuthSvc->>DB: Tim hoac tu tao tai khoan theo google_sub
    end
    AuthSvc->>AuthSvc: Sinh Access Token 15 phut
    AuthSvc->>AuthSvc: Sinh Refresh Token, luu hash SHA-256 vao DB
    AuthSvc-->>GW: Tra ve Access Token va Set-Cookie refresh_token
    GW-->>FE: Chuyen tiep phan hoi va Cookie HttpOnly
    FE->>FE: Luu accessToken trong bo nho RAM bien JS
    
    Note over FE,AuthSvc: Khi Access Token het han sau 15 phut
    FE->>GW: POST /api/auth/refresh (Cookie refresh_token)
    GW->>AuthSvc: Forward POST /api/auth/refresh
    AuthSvc->>DB: Kiem tra token neu da thu hoi thi THU HOI TOAN BO PHIEN
    AuthSvc->>DB: Thu hoi token cu, phat hanh token moi (Token Rotation)
    AuthSvc-->>FE: Cap Access Token moi va Cookie moi
